# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
.archives
# The Rajutan app is its own repository (github.com/sieteminerva/rajutan). It lives under
# `examples/` so the workspace links `@aio-ui/*` for development, but its history belongs
# to that repository — never track it twice.
/examples/rajutan/
# Local scratch area: throwaway runs, probes, generated sites. Safe to delete wholesale.
temp/
# `releases/` is a real checkout of the orphan `releases` branch (tarballs + the
# jsDelivr tree), created with `git worktree add`. It is ignored on `main` because a
# worktree must never be tracked twice — the folder itself is ordinary, visible and
# owned by that branch, not a scratch directory.
# Root only: a bare `releases/` also matched `docs/releases/`, so every release note
# was silently untracked (found 2026-11-21).
/releases/
dist
dist-ssr
*.local
draft

